 control system in  place  additionally moving forward  seeing more validation studies will  improve  either in our laboratory or  multi-laboratory studies  solidifying regulations as well as  more laboratories becoming iso  accredited as well as  certified laboratories within their  states  proficiency testing is another great  point to  touch on for laboratories this is great  for  making sure that your laboratory is  providing  accurate results it also allows you to  compare  with other laboratories and  just allows the laboratory to make sure  that they're doing things correctly  making sure you have a quality system in  place is really important for  laboratories as well as  standards and method development which  aac is doing a great job  pushing forward in this in this industry  and i think the most important part of  all of this  is the training education and outreach  for laboratories  and laboratory scientists and  technicians  and just making sure that everybody's on  the same page  working towards the same goals and like  i said  standardizing it so that we are all  producing  accurate quality data and  making sure that in between laboratories  things are able to come out looking the  same  and moving forward  basically as this industry grows we just  want to make sure we're growing with it  as a laboratory  too so making sure you're staying up to  date on  all the newest methods and staying up to  date  on how you can continually improve  your your laboratory workflow  is really important this is an  ever-changing thing  and we're always changing and improving  and making sure we're  we're growing with this industry  and feel free to email me  or ask any questions thank you so much  for joining me today

